      "content": "its 3am and i cant sleep on my break. been doing this job for 6 years now, night shift icu, and i just feel... nothing. like im going through the motions but theres nobody home anymore. does that make sense\n\ni used to care so much. now i watch people die and i just chart it and move on. i dont feel like a person\n\nbeen thinking lately about stopping everything. not just work. everything.",
